    question: 'Should I get an SSD or HDD at this price range?',
    answer: 'Always choose SSD. The speed difference is dramatic - Windows boots in seconds instead of minutes. Most budget laptops now include SSDs, but verify before buying. A 256GB SSD is better than a 1TB HDD for daily use.',
  },
