    question: 'Can budget laptops handle video calls?',
    answer: 'Yes, all laptops in this guide handle Zoom, Teams, and Google Meet smoothly. Look for models with decent webcams (1080p preferred) and good microphones. Most budget laptops have acceptable cameras for professional calls.',
