    question: 'How long do budget laptops last?',
    answer: 'Expect 3-5 years of productive use from a quality budget laptop. Build quality varies - ThinkPad and Dell Latitude series tend to last longer. Regardless of brand, take care of the battery and keep the laptop cool for maximum lifespan.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Is it worth buying a refurbished laptop?',
    answer: 'Certified refurbished laptops from manufacturers or authorized sellers can be excellent value - often 30-40% off retail. Look for at least a 90-day warranty and stick to reputable sellers. Avoid random marketplace refurbs without guarantees.',
